msgid "Warning"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:61
msgid ""
"If pinned VMs exist on the host, they will remain in place during "
"maintenance. Ensure these VMs can tolerate the host being serviced, or "
"manually relocate them before entering maintenance mode."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:63
msgid ""
"For permanent decommissioning, maintenance mode is only the evacuation "
"step. Complete the supported cluster removal and post-removal health "
"checks in :doc:`managing_hosts`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:66
msgid "VMs With Local Storage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:68
msgid ""
"VMs that have volumes on local datastores cannot be live-migrated. These "
"VMs must be powered off before the host enters maintenance mode. If a "
"running VM has local storage, maintenance mode will report a failure for "
"that VM and continue with the remaining VMs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:70
msgid "To handle VMs with local storage:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:72
msgid "Power off the VM manually before initiating maintenance mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:73
msgid ""
"Or move the VM's storage to a shared datastore before initiating "
"maintenance mode"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:76
msgid "Capacity Requirements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:78
msgid "Maintenance mode requires that remaining hosts can absorb the workload:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:80
msgid ""
"Each target host must have available memory greater than the VM's "
"allocated memory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:81
msgid "Projected utilization on the target host must remain below 95%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:82
msgid "If no host has sufficient capacity for a given VM, the operation fails"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:84
msgid "Important"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/host_maintenance.rst:84
msgid ""
"Plan cluster sizing with N+1 capacity to always allow at least one host "
"to enter maintenance. See :doc:`capacity_planning` for sizing guidance."
msgstr ""

